WEBVTT

37:12.167 --> 37:14.750
Do you know how it feels
to have a threat to your life?

37:14.834 --> 37:15.917
It wasn't me, sir.

37:16.000 --> 37:18.292
You can't sleep, relax,
or, do anything at all, in fact.

37:18.500 --> 37:20.875
You're always looking out
for an attack on you.

37:21.000 --> 37:24.375
Your heart keeps pounding
in your ears out of fear.
